            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "ACA insurance uncertainty leaves Americans 'in limbo'",
            "description": "<p>The future of <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/aca-credit-expiration-could-result-175044637.html\">Affordable Care Act (ACA) coverage</a> is uncertain as federal subsidies are <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/more-americans-uninsured-without-aca-232000115.html\">set to expire</a>.</p>\n<p>Grey Ghost Capital healthcare investor and Tenet Healthcare (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/THC\">THC</a>) board member, Meghan Fitzgerald, joins Market Catalysts to discuss the impacts on Americans.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
